00:11:27,764 --> 00:11:28,913
你们玩得开心
You guys have fun.

353
00:11:31,674 --> 00:11:32,420
怎么了
What happened?

354
00:11:32,420 --> 00:11:34,180
我的天
Oh, my God.

355
00:11:34,900 --> 00:11:37,060
别跳了 我们已经过时了
Stop. We're gancient.

356
00:11:39,709 --> 00:11:41,399
说真的 迪伦吗
Really? Dylan?

357
00:11:42,801 --> 00:11:44,600
-迪伦 -是啊 跟你发誓
- Dylan? - Yep. Swear it.

358
00:11:44,600 --> 00:11:46,160
简直不敢相信
Like you cannot believe.

359
00:11:47,272 --> 00:11:50,057
我现在好像有点懂了
You know what? I kind of get him now.

360
00:11:50,057 --> 00:11:50,980
-是吧 -没错
- Right? - Yes!

361
00:11:50,980 --> 00:11:52,600
我一直都很懂迪伦
I always got Dylan.

362
00:11:53,180 --> 00:11:54,740
小心点 你算是我外婆了
Careful. You're like my grandma.

363
00:11:56,120 --> 00:11:56,660
外婆
Grandma?

364
00:11:56,660 --> 00:11:59,470
小心点 我还捅过更亲密的家属呢
Easy. I have stabbed closer relatives than you.

365
00:12:01,320 --> 00:12:03,620
真不敢相信我在和我妈说这些
I can't believe I'm talking to my mom about this.

366
00:12:03,820 --> 00:12:04,320
宝贝 我说过了
Honey, I told you,

367
00:12:04,320 --> 00:12:05,300
你已经是个成年人了
you're a grown-up now.

368
00:12:05,300 --> 00:12:07,020
我会尊重你的选择
I'm gonna respect your decisions,

369
00:12:07,020 --> 00:12:08,640
让你过自己的生活
and let you live your life.

370
00:12:08,640 --> 00:12:10,460
这是我在你21岁生日里
It's the best gift I can give to you

371
00:12:10,460 --> 00:12:11,660
能给你的最好的礼物
on your 21st birthday,

372
00:12:11,660 --> 00:12:16,180
友谊 以及无条件的包容
my friendship and unconditional acceptance.

373
00:12:16,763 --> 00:12:18,782
知道这些对我来说真是太重要了
That means so much to me right now.

374
00:12:18,933 --> 00:12:20,580
-你知道为什么吗 -为什么
- You know why? - Why?

375
00:12:20,580 --> 00:12:22,840
因为我今晚想去纹身
Because I want to get a tattoo tonight,

376
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:24,280
但是我怕你不同意
and I was afraid you'd say no.

377
00:12:24,600 --> 00:12:25,600
她跟你说了这么多
How could she say no

378
00:12:25,600 --> 00:12:27,820
怎么可能会不同意呢
after everything she just said to you?!

379
00:12:27,980 --> 00:12:30,250
我怎么能不同意呢 有办法吗
How could I say no? Is there a way?

380
00:12:30,250 --> 00:12:32,512
天哪 妈 这是你送我的最好的礼物
Oh, my God, mom, this is the best present ever!

381
00:12:32,512 --> 00:12:34,254
今晚还能更棒吗
Could tonight get any better?!

382
00:12:34,254 --> 00:12:35,884
能啊 她可以替你付钱
Yes! She can pay for it

383
00:12:35,884 --> 00:12:37,922
这样你就可以纹个大的了
so you can get a really big one!

384
00:12:42,782 --> 00:12:44,148
我太激动了
I'm so excited!

385
00:12:45,920 --> 00:12:47,660
菲尔 你在哪 你得赶紧过来
Phil, where are you? You have to get down here

386
00:12:47,660 --> 00:12:49,080
不然海莉就要纹身了
and stop Haley from getting a tattoo.

387
00:12:49,080 --> 00:12:51,100
你说什么 快阻止她啊
What, no, you stop her!

388
00:12:51,100 --> 00:12:51,900
我阻止不了
I can't.

389
00:12:51,900 --> 00:12:53,560
我答应了要做她的朋友
I made a commitment to being her friend.

390
00:12:53,560 --> 00:12:54,640
你为什么要那样做
Why would you do that?

391
00:12:54,920 --> 00:12:56,480
我也不知道 就是想尝试些新事物
I don't know. I was trying something.

392
00:12:56,480 --> 00:12:58,680
开着新车过来 可以分散她的注意力
Just get down here with that car, and we can distract her.

393
00:12:58,680 --> 00:12:59,420
我倒是想啊
I'd love to,

394
00:12:59,420 --> 00:13:00,620
但是你爸一直在耍强硬手段
but your dad played hardball

395
00:13:00,620 --> 00:13:01,645
我没买到车
and we lost it.

396
00:13:01,645 --> 00:13:02,840
你怎么会让这种事发生呢
How on earth did you let that happen?!

397
00:13:02,840 --> 00:13:04,060
我不知道 你怎么不去问问
I don't know. Why don't you ask

398
00:13:04,060 --> 00:13:05,435
海莉脖子上那只小鸟
the tweety bird on Haley's neck?

399
00:13:05,435 --> 00:13:06,917
天哪 别纹在脖子上
Oh, God, not the neck.

400
00:13:06,917 --> 00:13:08,855
她这样已经很难找到工作了
She's a tough-enough hire as it is.

401
00:13:10,300 --> 00:13:11,720
你去处理车的事 我去处理纹身的事
Fine, y-you deal with the car. I'll deal with the tattoo.

402
00:13:11,840 --> 00:13:12,400
快点过来
Just get here.

403
00:13:13,520 --> 00:13:14,900
接下来我们要这么做
Okay, here's what we're gonna do.

404
00:13:14,920 --> 00:13:16,500
不 我已经听够你的唠叨了
No, no, no, no. I'm done listening to you.

405
00:13:16,500 --> 00:13:17,620
曾经有一份美好的折扣摆在我面前
I had a great deal.

406
00:13:17,620 --> 00:13:18,380
你知道我怎么知道的吗
You know how I know?

407
00:13:18,380 --> 00:13:20,380
当你还在吃第三个热狗的时候
I called the salesman at the first dealership

408
00:13:20,380 --> 00:13:21,420
我打给第一家代理店的销售员
while you were sneaking your third hot dog,

409
00:13:21,780 --> 00:13:22,780
车子已经卖出去了
and it already sold.

410
00:13:22,780 --> 00:13:24,000
没关系 反正我们也不要那辆车
Fine. We don't need it.

411
00:13:24,100 --> 00:13:24,980
接下来
Here's the plan,

412
00:13:25,160 --> 00:13:27,060
我们就说海莉病得很重
we tell them Haley is really sick.

413
00:13:27,340 --> 00:13:28,620
天哪 你真有病
Oh, my God, you're sick.

414
00:13:28,620 --> 00:13:30,520
真聪明 应该说是我病了
Good thinking! I'll be sick

415
00:13:30,780 --> 00:13:32,420
因为没人关心见不到的人
cause nobody cares about people they can't see.

416
00:13:32,420 --> 00:13:34,460
我已经在网上查了好几周的信息
I researched that car online for weeks,

417
00:13:34,460 --> 00:13:36,640
接着你自以为是地插进来一脚
and then you swoop in with your tough-guy swagger

418
00:13:36,640 --> 00:13:39,180
教我怎么在70年代买车
to teach me a lesson about buying cars in the 70s!

419
00:13:39,180 --> 00:13:41,340
这一切都是你的错
You know, this all happened because of you,

420
00:13:41,340 --> 00:13:44,080
坐在那 一句话也不敢说
sitting there, covered in sweat and fear,

421
00:13:44,080 --> 00:13:45,940
还拆我的台
undercutting my every word.

422
00:13:45,940 --> 00:13:47,500
你要真想拿到好的折扣
Now, if you want a really good deal,

423
00:13:47,500 --> 00:13:49,840
你就给我待在这里 继续上你的网
you park your butt out here, play on your internet.

424
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:52,160
我要按老方法来
I'm going old-school on this sales weasel,

425
00:13:52,160 --> 00:13:53,540
而且我会杀他个片甲不留
and I'm gonna break him in half.

426
00:13:55,220 --> 00:13:56,740
有人接待你们吗
Is somebody helping you?

427
00:13:56,740 --> 00:13:58,060
你最好拿下他
He better be!

428
00:13:58,060 --> 00:13:59,260
有 谢谢你
Yes, thank you so much.

429
00:14:01,440 --> 00:14:03,160
今晚是我当家
Okay, I am technically in charge tonight,

430
00:14:03,160 --> 00:14:04,000
所以谁都不准告诉莉莉
so no one tells Lily

431
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:04,840
孩子是怎么来的
where babies come from.

432
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:05,940
不能同意更多
I could not agree more.

433
00:14:05,940 --> 00:14:07,380
我搞不懂你们美国人为什么
I don't know why you Americans

434
00:14:07,380 --> 00:14:08,860
谈到性就这么紧张
are so uptight about sex.

435
00:14:08,860 --> 00:14:10,880
性对于年轻人来说是充满迷惑的
Sex is confusing for young people,

436
00:14:10,880 --> 00:14:12,100
她不需要从两个胡子都没长全的
and she doesn't need to learn from two fuzz-staches

437
00:14:12,640 --> 00:14:14,200
小屁孩那里知道这些
who barely know anything themselves.

438
00:14:14,200 --> 00:14:15,820
不好意思 你应该看看
Excuse me, you might want to

439
00:14:15,820 --> 00:14:16,960
我的网页浏览记录
check my browser history.

440
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:18,580
我已经做了不少研究
I've done some research.

441
00:14:18,900 --> 00:14:21,220
真好 现在我只想吐一辈子
Oh. Well, great. I'm just gonna go vomit forever now.

442
00:14:21,360 --> 00:14:22,685
你们在干什么
What are you guys doing?

443
00:14:22,685 --> 00:14:23,520
-没什么 -就在聊天而已
- Nothing. -Just talking.

444
00:14:23,520 --> 00:14:24,300
没什么特别的
Not really anything.

445
00:14:24,360 --> 00:14:26,000
我们能把话说完吗
Can we finish our conversation?

446
00:14:26,300 --> 00:14:28,300
不行 莉莉 抱歉 如果你有问题
No. Lily, I'm sorry, but if you have questions,

447
00:14:28,300 --> 00:14:29,100
只能去问你爸爸们了
you're gonna have to ask your dads.

448
00:14:29,240 --> 00:14:30,680
你们也不知道是不是
You don't know, do you?

449
00:14:30,680 --> 00:14:32,080
-我知道 -我知道
- I do so. - Uh-huh, I know.

450
00:14:32,080 --> 00:14:34,620
不 我们不知道 对不对
No, we don't. Right, guys?

451
00:14:34,774 --> 00:14:35,973
-不知道 -不知道
- No, I guess not. - No.

452
00:14:36,020 --> 00:14:39,260
太丢人了 要我告诉你们不
That's embarrassing. Want me to tell you?

453
00:14:39,260 --> 00:14:40,080
什么
What?

454
00:14:40,460 --> 00:14:43,000
你问我们知不知道小孩是从哪里来的
Hey, that's why you asked if we knew where babies came from --

455
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:44,420
是因为你想告诉我们吗
Because you wanted to tell us?

456
00:14:44,420 --> 00:14:46,760
是啊 你们都这么大了 该知道了
Yeah, you're old. You should know.

457
00:14:46,760 --> 00:14:48,780
不过你们最好坐下来听我讲
But you might want to sit down for this.

458
00:14:51,300 --> 00:14:53,720
我找到附近的一家纹身店
I found a tattoo shop nearby.

459
00:14:53,940 --> 00:14:57,180
大众点评上四颗星 军人还享有折扣
It has four stars on Yelp, and it has military discount.

460
00:14:57,180 --> 00:15:00,320
二等兵多切斯特前来报到
Well, Private Dorchester reporting for duty.

461
00:15:00,320 --> 00:15:02,380
你今晚真是乐于助人啊 歌洛莉亚
You are just so helpful tonight, Gloria.

462
00:15:02,660 --> 00:15:04,500
-知道你们还该干啥吗 -又有主意了
- You know what else you should do? - Another idea.

463
00:15:05,340 --> 00:15:07,520
你们该弄个母女纹身
You should do mother-and-daughter tattoos,

464
00:15:07,520 --> 00:15:09,920
比如一人纹半个爱心
like -- like, uh, two halves of a heart.

465
00:15:09,920 --> 00:15:11,700
或者星星配月亮
Or the moon and some stars.

466
00:15:11,700 --> 00:15:14,002
或者步枪配小鸟
Or, like, a bird and a rifle.

467
00:15:14,002 --> 00:15:15,996
天啊 就这么办
Oh, my God, let's do that!

468
00:15:15,996 --> 00:15:18,288
不是你说的那种 但可以弄个配对纹身
I mean, not that, but, like, let's get matching tattoos!

469
00:15:18,288 --> 00:15:19,500
我想和你有配对的纹身
I want to do that with you.

470
00:15:19,500 --> 00:15:21,420
-真的吗 -当然
- You do? - Yeah!

471
00:15:21,420 --> 00:15:23,160
那可以成为我们两人
It could be, like, our special thing

472
00:15:23,160 --> 00:15:25,600
这辈子最特殊的东西 只属于你和我
that we have for the rest of our lives, just us.

473
00:15:25,600 --> 00:15:27,880
不管我们去哪里 或是干什么
And no matter where we go or what we do,

474
00:15:27,880 --> 00:15:29,780
别人一问起我们的纹身
when people ask us about our tattoos,

475
00:15:29,780 --> 00:15:31,100
我们可以说它们来自
we can say that they're from

476
00:15:31,100 --> 00:15:33,063
我们生命中最精彩的夜晚
the best night of our lives together.

477
00:15:33,063 --> 00:15:34,276
太美好了
That is so sweet.

478
00:15:34,552 --> 00:15:35,372
我是说真的
I mean it.

479
00:15:35,873 --> 00:15:37,562
我想和你一起纹身 你愿意吗
I want to do it with you. Will you?

480
00:15:38,440 --> 00:15:41,920
不敢相信 但我愿意 我愿意
I can't believe this, but I will. I will.

481
00:15:41,920 --> 00:15:42,761
因为我爱你
I will 'cause I love you.

482
00:15:42,761 --> 00:15:44,137
-我也爱你 -我爱你 我爱你
- I love you, too! - I love you. I love you.

483
00:15:44,137 --> 00:15:46,103
-他们还可以做穿孔 -你够了
- They also have piercing! - Enough.

484
00:15:47,720 --> 00:15:49,060
说句实话吧
You know what?

485
00:15:49,060 --> 00:15:51,960
我其实不需要再当酷哥了
I don't even need to be cool anymore.

486
00:15:51,960 --> 00:15:52,958
有什么意义呢
It's like, why?

487
00:15:52,958 --> 00:15:55,640
是啊 有什么意义呢 谁在乎
Yes, exactly. Why? Who cares.

488
00:15:55,640 --> 00:15:57,380
再说了 不在乎自己酷不酷
Besides, isn't the cooler thing not caring

489
00:15:57,380 --> 00:15:57,960
不是更酷吗
if you're cool?

490
00:15:58,100 --> 00:15:59,680
是啊 如果新的酷是不在乎自己酷不酷
Yeah, and if the new cool is not caring,

491
00:15:59,680 --> 00:16:01,740
那说明我酷到极点 不过我也不在乎
then I'm supercool, not that I care.

492
00:16:01,740 --> 00:16:04,080
猜怎么着 我们要去弄配对纹身了
Hey, guys! Guess what. We're getting matching tattoos.

493
00:16:04,080 --> 00:16:06,400
不错 我们也要 我们需要弄这个
Love it. We're doing it, too. We need this.

494
00:16:06,400 --> 00:16:08,000
-你们认真的吗 -我们认真的吗
- Are you serious? - Are we serious?

495
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:10,520
像伯特和尔尼一样认真[芝麻街搭档角色]
As serious as Bert and Ernie.

496
00:16:11,760 --> 00:16:14,820
这本该是我作为父亲无比美好的一刻
It was supposed to be such a great moment for me as a dad.

497
00:16:15,280 --> 00:16:16,340
我本该走进那家酒吧
I was gonna walk into that bar,

498
00:16:16,500 --> 00:16:18,120
把新车钥匙交给女儿 对她说
give my daughter her new car keys, and say,

499
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:18,340
乖女儿
"Honey...

500
00:16:19,180 --> 00:16:21,360
把酒喝完 我们去兜风
Chug that drink. We're going for a spin."

501
00:16:24,340 --> 00:16:26,220
菲尔 把这放到你包包里吧
Phil, put these in your purse.

502
00:16:26,760 --> 00:16:29,020
我把你说砍不下来的价往下砍了500元
I just beat your unbeatable deal by 500 Samolians.

503
00:16:29,680 --> 00:16:30,980
你上网能弄到这么好的价钱吗
Stick that in your internet.

504
00:16:30,980 --> 00:16:33,480
-什么 -这家伙太强了 说服我了
- What? - This guy's a bulldog. He wore me down.

505
00:16:33,520 --> 00:16:35,700
别太责怪自己 你根本赢不了我的
Don't be too hard on yourself. You never stood a chance.

506
00:16:37,640 --> 00:16:38,860
谢谢 杰
Thank you, Jay.

507
00:16:38,860 --> 00:16:39,900
上车 我给你演示下操作
Hop in. I'll give you a walk-through.

508
00:16:40,520 --> 00:16:40,800
好的
Okay.

509
00:16:42,220 --> 00:16:44,400
再给点好消息 你的岳父
Some more good news for you -- your father-in-law

510
00:16:44,400 --> 00:16:46,958
还说服我给你装了两年免费的卫星广播
also talked me into two years of free satellite radio.

511
00:16:46,958 --> 00:16:49,893
那是自然 我从来都比不过他
Of course he did. The guy's always one-upping me.

512
00:16:50,380 --> 00:16:51,780
我为了拿到最好的价钱忙了一个月
I work for months getting the best deal.

513
00:16:51,780 --> 00:16:53,040
结果他一来 强势出击
He walks in, bullies you down,

514
00:16:53,040 --> 00:16:54,620
证明了我有多弱
and proves what a pushover I am.

515
00:16:55,300 --> 00:16:56,620
让我给你展示下这个喇叭
Let me just show you this horn.

516
00:16:56,980 --> 00:16:57,640
为什么 他也帮我升级
Why? Did he get an upgrade on --

517
00:16:57,640 --> 00:17:00,420
我岳父也挺贱的 所以我得给你说点事
My father-in-law can be a jerk, too, so I got to say something.

518
00:17:00,720 --> 00:17:02,300
你拿到的价格比他的低太多了
You got a much better deal than he got.

519
00:17:03,180 --> 00:17:04,720
这喇叭不错吧
Some horn, huh?

520
00:17:05,560 --> 00:17:05,920
什么
What?

521
00:17:05,920 --> 00:17:07,380
他到我的办公室来
He came groveling into my office

522
00:17:07,380 --> 00:17:08,100
跪求让我撒个谎
and begged me to lie

523
00:17:08,100 --> 00:17:09,360
让我说他把价格砍得更低
and say that he got the better price,

524
00:17:09,360 --> 00:17:10,260
但他给我补了差价
but he paid me the difference.

525
00:17:11,860 --> 00:17:12,740
他补了多少钱
How much more did he pay?

526
00:17:13,460 --> 00:17:15,320
天啊 他真的好在意我对他的看法
Oh, my God, he really cares what I think about him.

527
00:17:15,320 --> 00:17:17,180
-你没想到吧 -他真是个好人
- More than you know. - That is one beautiful man.

528
00:17:17,180 --> 00:17:19,020
傻蛋 别按喇叭了行不
Hey, dumbass, enough with the horn, huh?

529
00:17:19,797 --> 00:17:21,166
